# figures/ is a DELIVERABLE of this repo, not a build artifact: the
# KernelForge.jl README embeds figures/<GPU>/*.png by raw URL, so those PNGs
# must be tracked here. (They were ignored back when the plotter lived in the
# package repo and wrote its output into it.)
#
# Everything else a plotting run can drop — SVG/PDF exports, scratch PNGs
# outside figures/ — stays out.
*.svg
*.pdf
*.png
!figures/**/*.png
